issues.suggestedFix:
Use a UUID-typed @PathVariable for the persons update endpoint to match the problem statement and NoteResource. Change the PersonResource.updatePerson signature to accept a UUID and compare using equals. Example:
public ResponseEntity<Person> updatePerson(@RequestBody Person updatedPerson, @PathVariable("personId") UUID personId) {
    if (updatedPerson.getId() == null || !updatedPerson.getId().equals(personId)) {
        return ResponseEntity.badRequest().build();
    }
    return ResponseEntity.ok(personService.savePerson(updatedPerson));
}
This keeps the API consistent, avoids string conversions, and makes ID validation straightforward for students.
